Cell["\<\
This file contains the processing code for Model 2. Before running this file, \
you must have extinction time outputs from running Model 2 for each species \
for both time periods using Model2.nb. Edit import \
(\[OpenCurlyQuote]directory\[CloseCurlyQuote]) and export \
(\[OpenCurlyQuote]saveto\[CloseCurlyQuote]) locations for your own device.\
\>", "Text",
